A||||19||ezsurf||V-6 Throttle Body Diameter||||5||
Z||000000||ezsurf||11-08-2000||11:03 AM||||I'm trying to find out what is the stock throttle body diameter for the 2.8 V-6 engine.  Anybody have a clue?||||reg||5
Z||000001||HYPTNOTiSE||11-08-2000||11:18 AM||||Stock diameter on a V-6 TB is 52mm.  These TB's can be safely bored to 57mm.  If you're looking for a ported TB, dont buy from the fiero store, I know of a source that will port your TB and plenum for about half the cost of the TB from the fiero store.<P>Mike LeCompte||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FST2M6||11-08-2000||11:20 AM||||who mike?! i'll send ya mine... but just the TB.. i'll do the manifolds... has any one heard from Chris west about his dual TB intake idea? ||||reg||1
Z||000003||ezsurf||11-08-2000||11:35 AM||||Thanks Hyptnotise!  You'd think that a $100 Pontiac maintenance manual would have a little more detail, but it doesn't.||||reg||14
Z||000004||Alex4mula||11-08-2000||01:34 PM||||Darrell Morse will port your TB & plenum for $150 including return shipping. He did mine and it was a very nice job. He included the new size gasket too. I contacted him at 612-441-5679 or morse86@aol.com||||reg||1
Z||000005||HYPTNOTiSE||11-08-2000||02:12 PM||||They'res the source Trav. Thanks for the help there Alex!   Oh yeah Trav, tell darrel that i refered ya!  Me and darrell kick favors back and forth at each other. Darrell does really nice work.  I had him do just my TB, it comes back very clean and much bigger inside  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I had a local machine shop bore out my plenum.  Shaun hammit dynoed just my 57mm TB on his stock plenum and got 3 hp on a stock engine through out the entire RPM range!  I think thats pretty damn good!  With the plenum bored to match the TB hp gains would have been higher, and with a 3.1-3.4 the performance gains would be much higher.  Well worth the money, also a much louder sucking sound is heard from the engine. very cool  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>       Mike LeCompte<BR>86 Fiero GT 3.2L w/ Nitrous<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.tcac.net/~daddyg/hypsig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Alex4mula||11-08-2000||02:56 PM||||You welcome! Yes the TB he returns looks like new. I have it in my 3.4. Last Monday finally instaled my Borla exhaust, the last pice of my total upgrade. Now is time for finally geting it dynoed...||||reg||1
