Z||000009||88formula||11-09-2000||04:45 PM||||The difference is 2.6-ft. lbs. of torque and .2 horsepower. Is that really worth $150 or am I missing something here? These are the kind of gains my dyno program comes up with also.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Hawk||11-09-2000||07:06 PM||||The dyno doesn't look that impressive with the throttle body alone, but if it was used in conjunction with porting and polishing the heads and opening up the stock exhaust manifolds and a mild cam would it make a more substantial difference?||||reg||1
